OL,3,GNEWSAArchaeological finds in A66
OL,4,Aproject go on tour
OL,5,
OL,6,FArchaeological treasures unearthed in a
OL,7,Fdig near one of Cumbria's busiest roads
OL,8,Fare being displayed in a tour.
OL,10,FRare preserved Roman shoes, decorative
OL,11,Fjewellery, prehistoric stone tools and
OL,12,Fa Roman statuette are among the finds
OL,13,Funcovered by the Oxford Cotswold
OL,14,FArchaeology team as part of work on the
OL,15,FA66 between Penrith and Scotch Corner.
OL,17,FA free exhibition at Warcop, Appleby,
OL,18,FKirkby Thore, Penrith and Carlisle will
OL,19,Fshow hundreds of items found in
OL,20,Fexcavations which started last year.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
