OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAArchaeological finds in A66
OL,4,Aproject go on tour
OL,5,
OL,6,FOxford Archaeology project manager,
OL,7,FHelen Evans, said the discoveries gave
OL,8,F"tantalising glimpses" of how people in
OL,9,Fthe Eden Valley worked the land, their
OL,10,Fbeliefs, tools they used and how they
OL,11,Fdressed.
